    "description": "Demonstrates allOf for schema inheritance and composition.\nThis example shows how to extend base schemas with additional properties,\ncreating a type hierarchy similar to object-oriented inheritance.\n\n**Key Concepts:**\n- allOf: Schema must match ALL of the listed schemas (AND logic)\n- Common use case: Inheritance and extension patterns\n- Combines multiple schemas into one\n\n**Pattern:** Base schema + Extensions = Complete schema\n",
